### Uji API KatalogKu (PocketBase) dengan ekstensi VS Code "REST Client"
### Klik "Send Request" di atas setiap request, berurutan 1-9.

# Ganti sesuai server: localhost / IP server / URL Cloudflare
@baseUrl = http://IP_SERVER:8080/api
# Salin ke api.local.http sebelum mengisi password. File lokal diabaikan Git.
# Budi/email berikut adalah contoh dari panduan; sesuaikan akun uji Anda.
@testName = Budi
@testEmail = budi@itb.ac.id
@testPassword =
# Nilai di bawah diambil otomatis dari hasil request sebelumnya
@productId = {{list.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}
@userId = {{login.response.body.$.record.id}}

### 1. Cek gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Daftar produk (5 terbaru)
# @name list
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?perPage=5&sort=-created

### 3. Cari produk dengan filter PocketBase
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?filter=title~'kopi'

### 4. Detail produk
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### 5. Daftar akun
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{testName}}",
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}",
  "passwordConfirm": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### 6. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/auth-with-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identity": "{{testEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### 7. Tambah favorit
POST {{baseUrl}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": "{{userId}}",
  "product_id": "{{productId}}"
}

### 8. Lihat favorit saya
# @name favs
GET {{baseUrl}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Hapus favorit pertama
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/favorites/{{favs.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
